  "description": "Every blend mode over a half transparent backdrop and over none at all, on a frame with no background. The top bands put a blended rect across the edge of a translucent one, so its left half meets something and its right half meets nothing. Below, the same four modes on a symbol, a line, an arc and a cross, whose shape has no distance function and so draws triangulated, since the compositing formula carries a term for the part of the source landing where there is no backdrop and factors that reach the destination cannot carry it too: a multiply over nothing came out black where canvas draws the source plainly.",
